0..44 Comment "// This source defines `Lift` as a function."
45..47 Comment "//"
48..95 Comment "// `subst-subst` contains `substTwiceUnderLam`."
96..98 Comment "//"
99..175 Comment "// Two substitutions under an abstraction unfold both definitions. The outer"
176..252 Comment "// substitution unfolds at the stuck call of the inner one. The lifting call"
253..331 Comment "// unfolds to `Lift`. The recursive calls compare each part. The step converts"
332..368 Comment "// as the constructor form converts."
369..371 Comment "//"
372..386 Comment "// - see: #879"
